.0452],"k":"m"}]},{"img":"content/genshin/builds/travelerhydro/261111-225334/zh-3.webp","t":"content/genshin/builds/travelerhydro/261111-225334/zh-3.t.webp","w":1080,"h":1350,"kind":"why","links":[{"n":"Favonius Sword","r":[0.1093,0.2426,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"w"},{"n":"Freedom-Sworn","r":[0.1093,0.2996,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"w"},{"n":"Instructor","r":[0.5231,0.2559,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"a"},{"n":"Noblesse Oblige","r":[0.5231,0.3196,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"a"},{"n":"Deepwood Memories","r":[0.5231,0.39,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"a"},{"n":"Furina","r":[0.1231,0.5096,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Xiangling","r":[0.1648,0.5096,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.2065,0.5096,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Nilou","r":[0.1231,0.5607,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Nahida","r":[0.1648,0.5607,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Baizhu","r":[0.2065,0.5607,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Raiden Shogun","r":[0.1231,0.6178,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Nahida","r":[0.1648,0.6178,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Sangonomiya Kokomi","r":[0.2065,0.6178,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Kaedehara Kazuha","r":[0.1231,0.6748,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Xiangling","r":[0.1648,0.6748,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.2065,0.6748,0.0343,0.0274]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/travelerhydro/261111-225334/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Freedom-Sworn","text":"Provides team ATK and Normal/Charged/Plunging Attack buffs after Traveler triggers two reactions. Requires reliable reaction triggers; not a personal-DPS pick."},{"name":"Key of Khaj-Nisut","text":"HP increases its Elemental Mastery team-share potential after three Skill hits; the Hold Skill can build stacks. For reaction support; hold Skill enough to stack before swapping."},{"name":"Favonius Sword","text":"CRIT hits generate neutral particles."},{"name":"Sacrificial Sword","text":"ER plus a chance to reset Skill adds another Hydro hit and improves support-set reaction uptime. Additional Skill costs field time. High refinements preferred."},{"name":"Fleuve Cendre Ferryman","text":"Fishing sword grants Skill CRIT Rate and temporary Energy Recharge after using Skill; reliable free Burst support."},{"name":"Festering Desire","text":"Energy Recharge, Elemental Skill DMG Bonus and Skill CRIT Rate make it useful for a Skill-oriented build. Only if you own the limited event weapon. Event-limited."},{"name":"Amenoma Kageuchi","text":"Craftable ATK% sword refunds Energy after Burst based on Skill-use seeds, reducing the need for ER. Best with multiple Skill uses across a rotation."},{"name":"Skyrider Sword","text":"Accessible Energy Recharge stat stick for early-game support; its Burst-triggered movement and ATK buff matter little. Budget option until a stronger ER sword is available."}],"a":[{"names":["Instructor"],"text":"Trigger a reaction while on field to grant the team 120 EM for 8 seconds. Best when a reaction carry benefits from EM.","stats":"ER · Any / Hydro DMG · CRIT Rate (Favonius)"},{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"After Burst, grants 20% team ATK for 12 seconds.","stats":"ER · Hydro DMG / Any · CRIT Rate"},{"names":["Deepwood Memories"],"text":"Situational Dendro RES shred in Bloom or Hyperbloom if no better teammate can hold the set; uptime is limited.","stats":"ER · Hydro DMG / Any · CRIT Rate"}],"t":[{"name":"Fontaine Vaporize","members":["Traveler (Hydro)","Furina","Xiangling","Bennett"],"text":"Furina supplements Traveler’s weak Hydro application for Xiangling Vaporize. Bennett heals and batteries Xiangling; Traveler adds Fanfare via HP changes.","roles":["Hydro Support","Sub DPS / Buffer","Off-field DPS","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Bountiful Dewdrops","members":["Traveler (Hydro)","Nilou","Nahida","Baizhu"],"text":"Traveler aims Hydro at Dendro-marked enemies to make Nilou Bountiful Cores; Nahida supplies Dendro and Baizhu heals Bloom self-damage.","roles":["Hydro Driver","Bloom Enabler","Dendro Support","Healer / Shielder"]},{"name":"Rainstorm Hyperbloom","members":["Traveler (Hydro)","Raiden Shogun","Nahida","Sangonomiya Kokomi"],"text":"Kokomi covers Traveler’s Hydro downtime; Nahida creates Cores and full-EM Raiden triggers Hyperbloom. Traveler offers extra Hydro hits.","roles":["Hydro Support","Hyperbloom Trigger","Dendro Support","Hydro Healer / Driver"]},{"name":"They're doing their best guys","members":["Traveler (Hydro)","Kaedehara Kazuha","Xiangling","Bennett"],"text":"Xiangling maintains Pyro for Traveler’s final Skill hit to Vaporize; Bennett buffs ATK and Kazuha groups foes. Timing is essential.","roles":["On-field Skill DPS","Anemo Support","Pyro Enabler","Healer / Buffer"]}],"v":"Hold Skill DPS: Marechaussee Hunter with a CRIT sword; ATK% / Hydro / CRIT. Hold Skill drains HP and benefits from shields.\nVaporize Skill: EM or ATK% sands with a CRIT sword; Vaporize the finishing Torrent Surge with Pyro setup.\nNilou Bloom: Build level 90 and EM for owned Bloom triggers; pair Nilou, Dendro application and a reliable healer.\nHyperbloom Support: Favonius Sword with Instructor or Deepwood; pair a Dendro applicator and full-EM Electro trigger.\nBudget Support: Fleuve Cendre Ferryman or Skyrider Sword; prioritize ER and team-focused artifact passives.","n":2},"seo":{"roles":["Support / Sub DPS"],"about":"Hydro Traveler offers ranged Hydro hits through a stationary Hold Skill and a traveling Burst, but has limited application and little innate team utility. Use Favonius Sword or support artifacts in reaction teams, or build Skill DMG for a niche on-field playstyle.","pros":["Free Hydro access","Ranged Hydro Skill","Pneuma-aligned hit","Flexible support sets"],"cons":["Weak Hydro application","Stationary Hold Skill","Unreliable traveling Burst","High Burst energy needs","Limited personal damage"],"weapons":["Freedom-Sworn","Key of Khaj-Nisut","Favonius Sword","Sacrificial Sword","Fleuve Cendre Ferryman","Festering Desire","Amenoma Kageuchi","Skyrider Sword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Reaction support"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"ATK buffer"},{"sets":["Deepwood Memories"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Dendro teams"}],"main":["Energy Recharge","Hydro DMG Bonus / Any","CRIT Rate (Favonius) / CRIT DMG"],"stats":["ER: Team-dependent; often very high for each Burst","CRIT Rate: 45% - 65% with Favonius Sword","Support: Prioritize enough ER for planned Burst frequency","Skill DPS: Prioritize CRIT and ATK over Burst uptime"],"vars":[{"title":"On-field Hold Skill DPS","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Festering Desire","Skyward Blade","Fleuve Cendre Ferryman"],"arts":[{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Heart of Depth"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% sands, Hydro goblet, CRIT circlet; prioritize CRIT > ATK%. Ignore Burst ER if focusing on Skill.","teams":"Shielder or interruption resistance; Furina and Bennett can amplify damage.","when":"Use Hold Skill for repeated Dewdrops and a stronger ending Torrent Surge. HP drain activates Marechaussee CRIT Rate.","cond":"Stationary Skill; interruption severely hurts damage.","notes":"The Skill cannot trigger Xingqiu, Yelan or Beidou Burst follow-ups.","pre":false},{"title":"Vaporize Skill DPS","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Festering Desire","Freedom-Sworn","Fleuve Cendre Ferryman"],"arts":[{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Heart of Depth"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% or EM sands, Hydro goblet, CRIT circlet; damage and reaction stats before ER.","teams":"Reliable Pyro aura from Xiangling; Bennett; optional Anemo buffer.","when":"Set up Pyro before firing Traveler’s ending Torrent Surge to Vaporize its hit.","cond":"Careful Pyro aura and hit timing required.","notes":"This is a niche, lower-ceiling build; HP stacking is not optimal for Skill damage.","pre":false},{"title":"Nilou Bloom Driver","role":"On-field Hydro Driver","weapons":["Key of Khaj-Nisut","Sacrificial Sword","Fleuve Cendre Ferryman"],"arts":[{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Deepwood Memories"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Level 90; invest in EM for Blooms Traveler owns. Maintain enough ER only if using Burst each rotation.","teams":"Nilou and Dendro units only; bring strong healing such as Baizhu.","when":"Aim Hold Skill at Dendro-afflicted targets to trigger additional Bountiful Blooms.","cond":"Only Hydro and Dendro party members with Nilou.","notes":"Bloom ownership varies with application and rotation; do not assume all cores belong to Traveler.","pre":false},{"title":"Hyperbloom Utility","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Sword","Sacrificial Sword","Fleuve Cendre Ferryman"],"arts":[{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Deepwood Memories"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Build ER to desired Burst frequency, then Favonius CRIT Rate; Traveler does not need full EM.","teams":"Full-EM Kuki Shinobu or Raiden, Dendro application, and another Hydro source if needed.","when":"Supplement Hydro application while the Electro unit triggers Hyperblooms.","cond":"Often needs an extra Hydro unit for consistent cores.","notes":"Put Deepwood on a reliable Dendro unit when possible.","pre":false},{"title":"Free-to-Play Support","role":"Support","weapons":["Fleuve Cendre Ferryman","Amenoma Kageuchi","Skyrider Sword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER sands; CRIT Rate if using Favonius later. Damage stats are secondary to reliable support effects.","teams":"Reaction team for Instructor, or ATK-scaling carry for Noblesse.","when":"A low-cost way to use Hydro Traveler as a reaction enabler and artifact buffer.","cond":"Noblesse is weaker if Burst cannot be cast regularly.","notes":"Fleuve Cendre Ferryman boosts Skill CRIT Rate and grants ER after Skill, not HP.","pre":false}],"mats":["Brilliant Diamond Sliver","Brilliant Diamond Fragment","Brilliant Diamond Chunk","Brilliant Diamond Gemstone","","Teachings of Equity","Guide to Equity","Philosophies of Justice","Transoceanic Pearl","Stained Mask","Ominous Mask","Windwheel Aster","Transoceanic Pearl","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Not Priority"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Lvl 8 - 10"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Lvl 6 - 8 (optional)"}],"teams":[{"name":"Fontaine Vaporize","members":["Traveler (Hydro)","Furina","Xiangling","Bennett"]},{"name":"Bountiful Dewdrops","members":["Traveler (Hydro)","Nilou","Nahida","Baizhu"]},{"name":"Rainstorm Hyperbloom","members":["Traveler (Hydro)","Raiden Shogun","Nahida","Sangonomiya Kokomi"]},{"name":"They're doing their best guys","members":["Traveler (Hydro)","Kaedehara Kazuha","Xiangling","Bennett"]}]}}],"title":"Traveler (Hydro)","el":"Hydro"}